  "meaning": "On one profile at one world, the positive root's uniqueness among actual roots identifies it with the potency-free first being. Use that being's existing PureAct proof for immutability and eternity. The verified maximum-equals-root lemma supplies the nominal description's uniqueness condition under the listed causal and actuality premises. The full nominal bridge names this root GOD_4, and global GOD_4 unity and the explicit sufficiency map give the corresponding remaining field. Neither uniqueness of all necessary beings nor an intrinsic interpretation of the positive profile follows.",
